            {
                "entry_id": "9548fa4a-0c61-3804-83e3-2a28d1aa1ab4",
                "word": "cis",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "483679d5-8cbc-3e2b-b923-8687955db108",
                        "entry_id": "9548fa4a-0c61-3804-83e3-2a28d1aa1ab4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à des substituants se trouvant du même côté de l’axe d'une liaison chimique incapable de rotation libre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "202f35e7-e894-4792-a917-7976a60dd416",
                                "sense_id": "483679d5-8cbc-3e2b-b923-8687955db108",
                                "text": "Les esters du cholestérol portant une molécule d’acide gras insaturé de forme trans, en l’occurrence l’acide élaïdique (C18:1Δ⁹, trans), sont hydrolysés beaucoup moins rapidement que si l’acide gras est l’isomère naturel de forme cis, soit l’acide oléique (C18:1Δ⁹, cis)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fed187f-b9eb-4d1a-8463-8d09297b8a0e",
                                "sense_id": "483679d5-8cbc-3e2b-b923-8687955db108",
                                "text": "On dénomme ces diastéréoisomères par les appellations courantes \"Cis\" et \"Trans\" selon que les substituants identiques (ou les plus comparables) sont du même côté par rapport à l'axe de la double liaison ou ne le sont pas."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "248687c1-0436-47cc-9aaf-355f6a96f809",
                        "source_entry_id": "9548fa4a-0c61-3804-83e3-2a28d1aa1ab4",
                        "source_sense_ids": [
                            "483679d5-8cbc-3e2b-b923-8687955db108"
                        ],
                        "linkage_type": "antonyms",
                        "word": "trans"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "56c60f42-aba4-37ee-87b6-2866fb804298",
                "word": "cis",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                        "entry_id": "56c60f42-aba4-37ee-87b6-2866fb804298",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cisgenre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Transitude"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6477759d-7dd2-453c-8096-04a9a2d8c95d",
                                "sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                                "text": "« Cis » étant l’opposé de trans, il s’agit aussi d’une réalité sociale : non pas celle de ne pas subir de violences du fait de sa catégorie sociale sexuée (les femmes sont littéralement définies par les violences qu’elles subissent), mais la réalité d’être épargnée par les violences liées au changement de catégorie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c69275c-dc60-4d05-87bd-4682164e14f9",
                                "sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                                "text": "Impossible à calmer malgré nos tentatives, Iris semble écœurée que le cortège des transgenres soit finalement autorisé aux personnes cis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d48b2c56-f530-4b33-862f-4e2b65858569",
                                "sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                                "text": "Il y a beaucoup de personnes qui ont une vision très romantique [de la lutte armée], surtout les hommes cis blancs de mon entourage qui ne vont pas sacrifier leur carrière ou risquer leur vie, qui ne soutiennent que sur internet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38034c3f-a7d6-4c63-a2a8-6e253edfe22c",
                                "sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                                "text": "La réponse de Bridges est lunaire: beaucoup de femmes « cis » (des femmes nées dans un corps de femme et qui se reconnaissent comme femme) peuvent avoir des enfants, beaucoup de femmes cis ne peuvent en avoir, et beaucoup d’hommes trans peuvent en avoir."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07cd2edb-3a24-4bf5-a6a4-386cc38f4fae",
                        "source_entry_id": "56c60f42-aba4-37ee-87b6-2866fb804298",
                        "source_sense_id": "213977c2-6260-3d0f-93aa-4e97eade40d8",
                        "target_lang_word": "cis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bee56201-7ee5-3f5d-b33a-c2f18f4fb44f",
                                        "entry_id": "b1b693a5-6416-3e9d-be74-d6b6bc11817a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having two mutations on two genes on the same chromosome of a homologous pair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff3d492f-07c3-3bd1-aa87-59e1882dca5f",
                                        "entry_id": "b1b693a5-6416-3e9d-be74-d6b6bc11817a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of the side of the Golgi apparatus nearer to the endoplasmic reticulum."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dae8b3c-3ba2-3fb6-8329-0dd386d954c3",
                                        "entry_id": "b1b693a5-6416-3e9d-be74-d6b6bc11817a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In (or constituting, forming, or describing) a double bond in which the greater radical on both ends is on the same side of the bond."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3dea11b-a1c5-49d1-84d1-148d416cf01d",
                                                "sense_id": "5dae8b3c-3ba2-3fb6-8329-0dd386d954c3",
                                                "text": "9 is thought to survive longer when the CH = CH bond is cis and to favour the formation of another cis double bond in a propagation reaction involving its displacement by monomer. 10, on the other hand, is more likely to yield a trans double bond […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cf53032-9f7f-44b6-afa9-85c2a9d384e4",
                                                "sense_id": "5dae8b3c-3ba2-3fb6-8329-0dd386d954c3",
                                                "text": "However, a cis double bond causes a kink in the chain. (A cis double bond introduces a bend of about 42 into the linear hydrocarbon chain.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06369e97-b567-4a80-a16c-e0147989c23f",
                                                "sense_id": "5dae8b3c-3ba2-3fb6-8329-0dd386d954c3",
                                                "text": "A cis double bond is one where the hydrogen atoms are both on the same side. In contrast, a trans double bond has them on the opposite side."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09b3c075-09ee-31b3-951b-a078126e7950",
                                        "entry_id": "b1b693a5-6416-3e9d-be74-d6b6bc11817a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In (or constituting, forming, or describing) a coordination compound in which the two instances of a particular ligand are adjacent to each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "463e5296-8dba-43c1-87d0-72c1370add31",
                                                "sense_id": "09b3c075-09ee-31b3-951b-a078126e7950",
                                                "text": "The cis effect is the labilization of ligands which are cis to certain other ligands."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba389bba-83be-36ba-8bcb-3eeac4d8462a",
                                        "entry_id": "c0c97861-3df7-31c0-9315-91f70dcf5d88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cisgender (or sometimes cissexual): not trans (transgender or transsexual) nor non-binary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9056f92-c1ff-4b74-840e-f731fa994ab3",
                                                "sense_id": "ba389bba-83be-36ba-8bcb-3eeac4d8462a",
                                                "text": "We're demonized and criminalized as perverts out to trick and deceive cis hetero men; therefore anything that happens to us, we 'had coming.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8489c0a-6074-495d-9985-0e7c9861551a",
                                                "sense_id": "ba389bba-83be-36ba-8bcb-3eeac4d8462a",
                                                "text": "Oh yeah, because you know who's been long overdue a challenge? The trans community. Oh, they've had their guard down for too long if you ask me. They'll all be checking their privilege on the way home now thanks to you, you brave little cis boy!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfdbffb9-b2ec-492d-9c56-809696640243",
                                                "sense_id": "ba389bba-83be-36ba-8bcb-3eeac4d8462a",
                                                "text": "The reality is that LGBTQ+ people face challenges at disproportionally higher rates than their straight counterparts — drug use, sex work, and financial instability can be an unfortunate result. My privilege as a young cis white man whose parents weren't going to let me drown afforded me the ability to make those mistakes and live to talk about it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
